            "Frothy, foamy and fantastic! Meet our 1% Salicylic Acid Foaming Daily Face Wash that's super gentle on the skin and is great for acne prone skin. It is super effective in reducing & preventing acne and dissolving debris that clogs pores as it penetrates deeper in the pores because of its foaming format. The power-packed formula also contains Zinc PCA that controls oil production and limits the growth of acne-causing bacteria. Anti-inflammatory properties reduce redness and with regular use, the face wash softens skin and sloughs off dead skin with its gentle exfoliation. All in all, it's a gentle yet effective face wash for reducing active acne."
