            "Description": "Frothy, foamy and fantastic! Meet our 1% Salicylic Acid Foaming Daily Face Wash that's super gentle on the skin and is great for acne prone skin. It is super effective in reducing & preventing acne and dissolving debris that clogs pores as it penetrates deeper in the pores because of its foaming format. The power-packed formula also contains Zinc PCA that controls oil production and limits the growth of acne-causing bacteria. Anti-inflammatory properties reduce redness and with regular use, the face wash softens skin and sloughs off dead skin with its gentle exfoliation. All in all, it's a gentle yet effective face wash for reducing active acne.",
            "Real People Real Stories": "Sameera Das\n\n5.0\n\nReally Happy With the Product\n\nI have really oily and acne-prone skin and this Derma co salicylic acid foaming face wash has been a gamechanger! It has healed my active acne and my skin feels much smoother! Love it!\n\nArun Jain\n\n5.0\n\nSavior For Oily Skin People\n\nI am using this product for a while, and it's the only face wash that hasn't given me a single pimple till now. It helps reduce acne and the texture. My pores look much smaller and my skin texture is much much better.\n\nBhavya Tripathi\n\n5.0\n\nBest Face Wash For Acne\n\nI had terrible acne on my cheeks and chin and after using this for a month, I can see a huge difference in my skin. I don't get acne as often as I did and it keeps my skin oil-free.",
            "Really Happy With the Product": "Sameera Das\n\n5.0\n\nReally Happy With the Product\n\nI have really oily and acne-prone skin and this Derma co salicylic acid foaming face wash has been a gamechanger! It has healed my active acne and my skin feels much smoother! Love it!",
            "Consumer Testing Results": "Consumer Testing Results\n\n80%\n\n80% of consumers saw improvement in active acne and clogged pores after using Salicylic Acid.",
            "Benefits to Love": "Reduces & Prevents Acne\n\nThis super gentle face wash is very effective in reducing and preventing acne by dissolving debris that clogs pores.\n\nControls Oil Production\n\nSay hello to oil-free skin! Zinc PCA in this face wash controls oil production while limiting the growth of acne-causing bacteria.\n\nGently Exfoliates Skin\n\nThe 1% Salicylic Acid Foaming Daily Face Wash sloughs off dead skin with gentle exfoliation resulting in smoother, brighter skin.",
            "Reduces & Prevents Acne": "Reduces & Prevents Acne\n\nThis super gentle face wash is very effective in reducing and preventing acne by dissolving debris that clogs pores.",
            "Key Ingredients": "Salicylic Acid\n\nA keratolytic agent that penetrates deep into the skin and dissolves the skin debris that clogs pores. It reduces acne and gets rid of blackheads and whiteheads.\n\nZinc PCA\n\nIt helps regulate oil production and has strong anti-microbial activity which further limits the growth of acne-causing bacteria.\n\nPHA\n\nIt is a gentle yet effective exfoliant that helps remove dead skin cells from the surface, resulting in smoother and brighter skin.",
            "Salicylic Acid": "Salicylic Acid\n\nA keratolytic agent that penetrates deep into the skin and dissolves the skin debris that clogs pores. It reduces acne and gets rid of blackheads and whiteheads.",
