            "FAQ": "Why is a hydrating face wash important?\nA hydrating face wash is essential for cleansing without stripping your skin's natural moisture, ensuring it stays healthy, balanced, and hydrated.\n\nIs a hydrating face wash right for all skin types?\nYes, it's suitable for normal, dry, and sensitive skin types, providing gentle cleansing and hydration.\n\nHow can a hydrating face wash cleanse my skin without drying it out?\nIt’s infused with Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramides, and Japanese Rice Water, which cleanse while restoring and maintaining your skin’s moisture balance.\n\nWhat other benefits can I expect from a hydrating face wash?\nIt boosts your skin’s barrier function, balances pH levels, and provides intense hydration without over-drying.\n\nHow often should I wash my face with a hydrating cleanser?\nHow often should I wash my face with a hydrating cleanser?\n\nCan I use other skincare products with a hydrating face wash?\nAbsolutely! Follow with toner, serum, and moisturizer for a complete skincare routine.\n\nIs water temperature important when using a hydrating face wash?\nYes, use lukewarm water to avoid stripping your skin of natural oils and to maximize hydration.\n\nCan a hydrating face wash remove makeup?\nIt can remove light makeup, but for heavy makeup, use a dedicated makeup remover first for thorough cleansing.",
