            "Description": "Your favorite ingredient is now in a face wash! It’s time to upgrade your skincare routine with The Derma Co. 1% Kojic Acid Face Wash that reduces dark spots, and pigmentation and makes your skin radiant and clearer. The powerful combination of Kojic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, & Niacinamide brightens, evens, and gives you a spotless and radiant complexion. This facewash stays super gentle on this skin and does not feel dry post-wash because it does not strip out the essential moisture of the skin while cleansing, Formulated for all skin types.",
            "Real People Real Stories": "Ruchi Singhal\n\n5.0\n\nKojic Acid In A Face Wash!\n\nThis is an amazing product which is hardly available in the market with other brands. It's safe & works amazing on my skin. A must-have product!\n\nNaveen Malhotra\n\n5.0\n\nMy Ultimate Skincare Partner!\n\nI have found my go-to face wash as it's extremely effective. The best part is this easy-to-carry tube that makes me take my skin BFF wherever I go!\n\nSubha Sharma\n\n5.0\n\nIt is the Most Perfect Face Wash EVER!\n\nMy skin got extremely pigmented & needed something to reduce my dark spots. I came across The Derma Co & it changed my skin! I love this face wash and now can't live without it!",
            "Kojic Acid In A Face Wash!": "Ruchi Singhal\n\n5.0\n\nKojic Acid In A Face Wash!\n\nThis is an amazing product which is hardly available in the market with other brands. It's safe & works amazing on my skin. A must-have product!",
            "Consumer Testing Results": "Consumer Testing Results\n\n80%\n\n80% of consumers found improvement in their skin pigmentation & dark spots after using Kojic Acid.",
            "Benefits to Love": "Reduces Dark Spots\n\nApply, wash & voila! Now bring out clear & radiant skin with the powerful trio of Kojic Acid, Niacinamide & Alpha Arbutin and say goodbye to dark spots.\n\nFights Pigmentation\n\nWith this face wash, you can say goodbye to pigmentation and hello to clear, healthy, and spotless skin. Best part? It's great for all skin types.\n\nNon-Drying Formulation\n\nAn amazing non-greasy, non-drying formulation enhances & maintains healthy hydration & nourishment without stripping away essential moisture.",
            "Reduces Dark Spots": "Reduces Dark Spots\n\nApply, wash & voila! Now bring out clear & radiant skin with the powerful trio of Kojic Acid, Niacinamide & Alpha Arbutin and say goodbye to dark spots.",
            "Key Ingredients": "Kojic Acid\n\nReduces pigmentation, dark spots & scars for smoother & radiant glow.\n\nNiacinamide\n\nIt fades dark spots, and evens skin tone for you to live life filter-free.\n\nAlpha Arbutin\n\nFades effective hyperpigmentation like dark spots, melasma, and gently evens skin tone.",
            "Kojic Acid": "Kojic Acid\n\nReduces pigmentation, dark spots & scars for smoother & radiant glow.",
            "How to use": "Step 1\n\nSqueeze out an adequate amount of face wash & gently massage over wet skin\n\nStep 2\n\nRinse well & pat dry\n\nStep 3\n\nUse twice a day for better results",
            "Step 1": "Step 1\n\nSqueeze out an adequate amount of face wash & gently massage over wet skin",
            "Suitable for": "Looking for a cleanser that reduces dark spots & treats pigmentation? This face wash is for you!\n\nThis face wash is perfectly suitable to all skin types",
            "Patch testing": "We at The Derma Co. take skincare seriously. To us, solving problems remains the primary goal. We want to ensure each one of you that our products are dermatologist-approved and highly effective.\n\nSteps for Patch Testing:-\n\n1. Clean a patch of skin on the upper forearm and apply a small amount of the product\n\n2. Wait for 15-20 minutes or a maximum of 30 minutes\n\n3. If any itching, redness, burning, blistering or irritation is observed, wash the area, and do not use the product\n\nPlease Note: A patch test is only for determining early irritation reaction to product(s) and does not promise similar results when applied to other areas(s) of the body, including the face or after regular use. A patch test does not account for any underlying conditions and should not be used for the diagnosis of hypersensitivity or allergic contact dermatitis.",
            "Ingredients List": "Myristic Acid, Glycerin, Aqua, Potassium Hydroxide, Propylene Glycol, Stearic Acid, Decyl Glucoside, Lauric Acid, Glycol Distearate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Xylitol, Glucose, Anhydroxylitol, Phoenix Dactylifera (Date Palm) Extract, Kojic Acid Dipalmitate, Niacinamide, Sodium PCA, Glyceryl Stearate, Phenoxyethanol, Polyquaternium-7, Titanium Dioxide, Sodium Metabisulfite, Butylated Hydroxytoluene, Vitamin E, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-t-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Disodium EDTA, Glyceryl Glucoside and Alpha Arbutin.",
            "FAQ": "What is The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Face Wash?\n\nThe Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Face Wash combines 1% Kojic Acid, Niacinamide, and Alpha Arbutin to help reduce dark spots, pigmentation, and dullness while offering gentle exfoliation.\n\nIs The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Face Wash suitable for all skin types?\n\nYes, it is dermatologically tested and suitable for all skin types, including oily and sensitive skin, due to its mild foaming formula and hydrating ingredients.\n\nHow should I apply The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Face Wash for the best results?\n\nApply a small amount on damp skin, gently massage in circular motions, and rinse thoroughly. Use twice daily for best results and follow with sunscreen in the daytime.\n\nWhat does The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Face Wash do for skin?\n\nThis face wash helps fade pigmentation and dark spots, evens out skin tone, and provides gentle exfoliation for smoother, clearer-looking skin.\n\nIs Alpha Arbutin good for the face?\n\nYes, Alpha Arbutin (an inhibitor) targets excess melanin production, helping visibly reduce pigmentation and brighten the skin safely.\n\nWhat is the best brand of Alpha Arbutin face wash?\n\nThe Derma Co is among the best alpha arbutin face wash options available, featuring clinically proven actives like Kojic Acid and Niacinamide.\n\nWhat are the ingredients in The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Kojic Acid Face Wash?\n\nKey actives include Kojic Acid (pigmentation control), Alpha Arbutin (melanin inhibitor), and Niacinamide (fades dark spots), which work together to improve skin clarity.\n\nAre there any side effects of The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Kojic Acid Face Wash?\n\nIt is generally well tolerated, though mild irritation can occur for very sensitive skin. Always patch test before regular use.\n\nWhat role does Alpha Arbutin play as a pigment inhibitor?\n\nAlpha Arbutin (inhibitor) slows down melanin formation in the pigmentation pathway, helping fade existing spots and prevent new discoloration.\n\nCan I use Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin together on my face?\n\nYes, their combination is safe and effective. Kojic Acid gently exfoliates while Alpha Arbutin inhibits melanin production for visible radiance.\n\nWhat are the benefits of The Derma Co Alpha Arbutin Face Wash?\n\nBenefits include reduced pigmentation, fewer dark spots, improved radiance, and enhanced clarity through a kojic acid niacinamide alpha arbutin face wash formulation.",
            "Disclaimer And Additional Information": "1. The product contains natural ingredients & may change color and fragrance, without losing effectiveness.\n\n2. Even natural ingredients can cause and trigger existing allergies. A patch test is recommended.\n\n3. In case of any rashes or allergy, please consult a specialist.\n\n4. All images shown are for illustration purpose only, actual results may vary.\n\n5. For external use only. Store in a cool & dry place.",
