            "FAQ": "1. Is this gel face wash soap-free & sulphate-free?\nYes. Strawberry Bright Gel Face Wash is soap-free & sulphate-free, making it gentle & non-drying while providing a deep cleansing action.\n\n2. Is it suitable for oily & acne-prone skin?\nYes. This face wash is suitable for oily skin, as the Niacinamide in this formula helps regulate excess oil for smoother, more even-toned skin. Although this face wash is gentle & free from harsh chemicals, for acne-prone skin, we’ll recommend Cica Calming Gel Face Wash, specially made for oily, acne-prone skin. Infused with cica, salicylic & other acne healing ingredients, it controls excess oil, reduces acne & calms redness.\n\n3. Does it help with dullness & uneven skin tone?\nPowered by Niacinamide, this face wash reduces dullness & improves skin clarity for visibly smoother, brighter & even-toned skin with regular use.\n\n4. Is it suitable for sensitive skin?\nWhile the formula is designed to be gentle, if you have very sensitive skin, we recommend doing a patch test before use. Additionally, if you are looking for a face wash for sensitive skin, we recommend using Barrier Repair Hydrating Gentle Face Wash.\n\n5. Can you recommend a complete routine with this face wash?\nStrawberry Face Wash→ Strawberry+10% Niacinamide Face Serum→ Strawberry Moisturizer→ Strawberry Tinted Sunscreen",
