            "See Full Ingredients": "Aqua, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Decyl Glucoside, Glycerine, Disodium Cocoyl Glutamate, Triethanolamine, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Xanthan Gum, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Niacinamide, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA, Menthol, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Panthenol, Glycerin (and) Water (and) Terminalia Ferdinandiana Fruit Extract, Citrus Sinensis (Blood Orange) Fruit Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Benzyl Alcohol (and) Ethylhexylglycerin (and) Tocopherol, Fragrance, CI 15985, CI 19140.\n\n Please be aware that our ingredient list is currently undergoing a transition. As a result, the ingredients listed on this page may vary from those on the product you receive. Rest assured, the product's safety, quality, and performance remain unchanged.",
            "Product Benefits": "Deeply cleanses\n without over-drying\nFights \ndullness & helps de-tan\nVisibly \nboosts glow\nFades \ndark spots & pigmentation\nGentle, \nsulphate-free formulation",
            "How To Use": "Take a small amount\nApply to wet face\nMassage gently for 20 seconds\nRinse & pat dry\nFollow with serum, moisturizer & sunscreen\nNote: Use twice daily (AM & PM) for best results",
            "FAQ": "What are the benefits of Vitamin C and E in a face wash?\nVitamin C brightens skin, fades dark spots, and reduces dullness, while Vitamin E nourishes and protects, leaving your skin glowing and even-toned.\n\nHow often should I use this face wash?\nUse it twice daily, morning and night, for best results.\n\nCan I use other skincare products with this face wash?\nAbsolutely! Follow with your favourite serum, moisturizer, and sunscreen for a complete skincare routine.\n\nIs it okay to use a Vitamin C + E Gel Face Wash around my eyes?\nAvoid the eye area to prevent irritation, as the skin around your eyes is more delicate.\n\nCan Vitamin C irritate my skin?\nIt's generally gentle, but if irritation occurs, use it once daily or every other day.\n\nHow long will it take to see results from using this face wash?\nYou'll start noticing a brighter, more even skin tone within a few weeks of consistent use.",
