            "Product Description": "#\n\nSimple Protect N Glow Vitamin C Glow Facial Wash contains the most effective & stabilised Vitamin C making it most advanced and potent range for naturally glowing and bright skin\n\nWith combination of Vitamin C and Niacinamide, it is one of the best facewashes with scientifically proven technology for instant glow and fresh skin\n\nInfused with Yuzu Lemon, this 100% soap-free face wash thoroughly washes away make-up, dirt, and impurities for clean, fresh, and glowing skin\n\nSimple Protect N Glow Vitamin C Glow Facial Wash contains no colour, no perfume, no alcohol, and no harsh chemicals or parabens\n\nDermatologically approved, Ophthalmologically tested, Hypoallergenic and Non-Comedogenic\n\nSimple Protect N Glow Vitamin C Glow Facial Wash is suitable for all skin types, even the most sensitive ones\n\nVegan, PETA certified cruelty free & Kind to Planet.\n\n# Net Weight: 150 ml\n Manufacturer Information: Hindustan Unilever Ltd, Unilver House, B D Sawant Marg, Chakala Andheri East - 400100\n Country Of Origin: India\n Best Before: **30 Months (From date of Manufacturing)",
