            "What's Special\n+\n-": "Brightening Blend \n\n:\n Contains stabilised \nVitamin C\n that does not break down when exposed to air, light or water. \n\n Yuzu Lemon Infusion \n\n:\n Infused with Yuzu Lemon for a refreshing cleanse that helps to brighten your skin.\n\n 100% Soap-Free \n\n:\n A gentle formula that cleanses without drying out your skin.\n\n Free From 2000+ Harsh Ingredients \n\n:\n No artificial colours, perfumes, or over 2000 potentially harmful chemicals.",
            "Ingredients\n+\n-": "Vitamin C, Natural Yuzu Extract Vitamin B3 Pro-Vitamin B5, Aqua, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Glycerin, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Sodium Chloride, Sodium benzoate, Citric acid, Niacinamide, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Panthenol, Citrus Junos Fruit Extract.",
            "Benefits\n+\n-": "Instant Glow \n\n:\n Reveals naturally glowing skin with a combination of Vitamin C and Niacinamide.\n\n Effective Cleansing \n\n:\n Thoroughly removes makeup, dirt, and impurities while leaving skin fresh and clean.\n\n Gentle and Non-Drying \n\n:\n Soap-free formula that cleanses without stripping or drying out the skin.",
            "How to Use\n+\n-": "1\n\n:\n\nApply a small amount of Vitamin C Glow Facial Wash to wet hands.\n\n2\n\n:\n\n Gently massage onto the face in circular motions, avoiding the eye area.\n\n3\n\n:\n\n Rinse thoroughly with water. \n\n4\n\n:\n\n Follow this up with Simple’s \n10% Vitamin C+E+F Serum\n and \nVitamin C Moisturising Glow Gel\n.",
            "FAQs\n+\n-": "1\n\n:\n\nWhat makes this facial wash effective for brightening? \n\nYes, Vitamin C enhances radiance and evens out skin tone, giving you a natural glow.\n\n2\n\n:\n\n Can I use this facial wash if I have sensitive skin? \n\nYes, it is specially formulated to be gentle on all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\n3\n\n:\n\n How often should I use the Vitamin C Glow Facial Wash? \n\nFor best results, use it twice daily—morning and night—as part of your \nregular skincare routine\n.\n\n4\n\n:\n\n Does this facial wash contain artificial colours or perfumes? \n\nNo, it is free from artificial colours, perfumes, and over 2000 harsh chemicals, making it ideal for sensitive skin.\n\n5\n\n:\n\n Can this facial wash improve my skin’s glow? \n\nYes, the unique blend of Vitamin C and Yuzu Lemon helps to boost your skin’s brightness and overall glow, making it look more refreshed.",
            "Product details\n+\n-": "Name of the product\n\n:\nVitamin C Glow Facial Wash 150ml\n\nNet weight\n\n:\n150ml\n\nManufacturer Information \n\n:\n Hindustan Unilever Ltd, Unilever House, B D Sawant Marg, Chakala Andheri East - 400100\n\nCountry Of Origin \n\n:\n India\n\nBest Before \n\n:\n **30 Months (From date of manufacturing)\n\nMRP (Incl. of all taxes)\n\n:\n₹490\n\nUnit Sale Price\n\n:\n₹3.26\n\n /ml",
