          "important_info": {
            "Product Description": "#\n\nBoosts hydration, supporting skin barrier health for supple, soft skin.\n Formulated with coacervation technology to help increase deposition of skin-loving goodies like ceramide boosters, hyaluronic acid, provitamin b5, to help replenish and retain hydration.\nThe 11% ceramide boosters boost the skinâ€™s natural ceramide production, helping replenishing skinâ€™s natural lipid barrier for instantly soft, supple and bouncy skin.\nGlycerin and hyaluronic acid help repair skinâ€™s moisture barrier, for smoother, more nourished skin.\nReplenishing formula that goes beyond gentle cleansing by helping to restore skin-essential nutrients for hydrated, plump, and healthy-looking skin.\nThis skin pH-Neutral and Sulfate-free blend of amino-acid derived cleanser works together to gently remove oil, pollution and make-up without drying the skin.\n\n# Manufacturer Information: Hindustan Unilever Ltd, Unilever House, B D Sawant Marg, Chakala Andheri East - 400099\nCountry Of Origin: India\nBest Before: **30 Months (From date of Manufacturing)",
            "About the product": "Soft skin. Stronger barrier. Simple.\n\nCleansing shouldn't leave your skin feeling tight, dry or stripped. Simple Repair+ Active Barrier Repair Hydrating Cleanser deeply replenishes your skin barrier with one wash, while gently removing daily build-up.\n\nPowered by 11% Pro-Ceramides + Hyaluronic Acid, our cleanser helps replenish your skin barrier from the inside out and boost your skin's natural ceramides. It restores dry and dehydrated skin from the 1st use, leaving it feeling soft, smooth and hydrated.\n\nMade for sensitive skin, the formula is skin pH balanced and sulphate free.",
            "What's Special\n+\n-": "Barrier care, built into your cleanse.\n\n11% Pro-Ceramides \n\n:\n Think of these as barrier boosters for your skin. Pro-Ceramides are smaller than regular ceramides, allowing them to penetrate deeper into the skin and help replenish your barrier from the inside out.\n\nDeep barrier replenishment \n\n:\n Your cleanser can do more than cleanse. Our formula deeply replenishes your skin barrier with one wash, helping restore dry and dehydrated skin from the 1st use.\n\nHydration that stays after cleansing \n\n:\n Powered by Hyaluronic Acid to boost hydration, leaving skin feeling soft and supple after every wash.\n\nSkin pH balanced. Soap-free. Sulphate-free. \n\n:\n A cleanser that works with your skin, not against it. The formula is balanced close to your skin's natural pH and made without sulphates.",
            "Ingredients\n+\n-": "11% Pro-Ceramides + Hyaluronic Acid\n\nPro-Ceramides\n\nHelp boost your skin's natural ceramides and replenish the skin barrier from the inside out.\n\nHyaluronic Acid\n\nBoosts hydration, leaving skin feeling soft and supple.",
            "Benefits\n+\n-": "Here’s what it does for your skin\n\nRestores dry and dehydrated skin from 1st use\n\nVisibly transforms skin in 1 week\n\nDeeply replenishes your skin barrier with one wash\n\nHelps replenish your skin barrier from the inside out\n\nHelps boost your skin's natural ceramides\n\nBoosts hydration\n\nLeaves skin feeling soft and smooth\n\nClinically proven results\n\nDermatologically tested on sensitive skin\n\nSkin pH balanced\n\nSulphate free",
            "How to Use\n+\n-": "1\n\n:\n\nCleanse. Rinse. Repair.\n\n2\n\n:\n\nWet your face with water. Massage the cleanser gently over your skin, avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly and pat dry.\n\n3\n\n:\n\nUse morning and evening, or whenever your skin needs a fresh start.",
            "FAQs\n+\n-": "1\n\n:\n\nIs Simple Repair+ Active Barrier Repair Hydrating Cleanser suitable for sensitive skin?\n\n Yes. It is dermatologically tested on sensitive skin and formulated to gently cleanse while helping replenish the skin barrier.\n\n2\n\n:\n\nDoes the cleanser help repair the skin barrier? \n\n Yes. It helps replenish the skin barrier from the inside out and supports your skin’s natural ceramide levels.\n\n3\n\n:\n\nWhat do 11% Pro-Ceramides do? \n\n Pro-Ceramides help replenish the skin’s natural ceramides, which are essential to the skin barrier. This helps strengthen and support the barrier.\n\n4\n\n:\n\nDoes it contain Hyaluronic Acid? \n\n Yes. Hyaluronic Acid helps attract and retain moisture, leaving skin feeling hydrated, soft and supple after cleansing.\n\n5\n\n:\n\nIs the cleanser sulphate-free? \n\n Yes. It is sulphate-free, making it suitable for a gentle daily cleansing routine.\n\n6\n\n:\n\nIs the cleanser pH balanced? \n\n Yes. The formula is skin pH-balanced to cleanse without disrupting your skin’s natural balance.\n\n7\n\n:\n\nWill it leave my skin feeling dry after cleansing? \n\n No. It gently cleanses while helping replenish the skin barrier, leaving skin feeling soft, smooth and hydrated after washing.\n\n8\n\n:\n\nCan I use it every day? \n\n Yes. It is designed for everyday use and can be used as part of your morning and evening cleansing routine.",
            "Product details\n+\n-": "Name of the product\n\n:\nSimple Repair+ Active Barrier Repair Hydrating Cleanser, 150ml\n\nNet weight\n\n:\n150ml\n\nManufacturer Information \n\n:\n Hindustan Unilever Ltd, Unilever House, B D Sawant Marg, Chakala Andheri East - 400099\n\nCountry Of Origin \n\n:\n India\n\nBest Before \n\n:\n 36 Months (From date of manufacturing)\n\nMRP (Incl. of all taxes)\n\n:\n₹490\n\nUnit Sale Price\n\n:\n₹3.26\n\n /ml",
            "Ways in which we collect your personal data": "Any personal data provided to or collected by Unilever is controlled by\n\nHindustan Unilever Limited\n, the \ndata controller\n.",
            "Profiling": "We \ncollect\n, \nprocess\n and \ndisclose\n your personal data only\n for specific and limited \npurposes\n. For example, to process your\n payments\n, to\n assess and handle any \ncomplaints\n, to \ndevelop and improve\n our products,\n services, communication methods and the functionality of our websites, to provide\n\npersonalised\n products, communications and targeted advertising as well as product\n recommendations to you.",
            "International data transfers": "As part of the Unilever Group, a global business, Hindustan Unilever Limited shares your personal data\n\nwithin the Unilever Group\n and with \nselected third-parties\n in the following\n circumstances:",
            "Additional Privacy Terms or Notices": "We will \nupdate\n this Privacy Notice when necessary to reflect customer feedback and changes in\n our products and services. When we post changes to this statement, we will revise the “\nlast updated\n” date at the top of this Notice. If the changes are significant, we will provide a more prominent\n\nnotice\n (including, for certain services, email notification of Privacy Notice changes). We\n will also keep prior versions of this Privacy Notice in an archive for your review.",
            "Duration of the cookie we use": "Cookies\n, \npixel tags\n and \nsimilar technologies \n(collectively\n ‘cookies’) are files containing small amounts of information which are downloaded to any internet enabled\n device – such as your computer, smartphone or tablet – when you visit a website. Cookies are then sent back to\n the originating website on each subsequent visit, or to another website that recognises that cookie. Cookies\n do lots of different and useful jobs, such as remembering your preferences, generally improving your online\n experience, and helping us to offer you the best product and services."
          },
